# Thornvault Forager: "{T}, Forage" can't be activated with a graveyard of two cards and no Food (CR 701.61a: three cards, or a
# Food), but its other mana ability, "{T}: Add {G}", still can, and is the one a plain activation takes. Turn 1: Forager and two
# Lightning Bolts; turn 3: the forage is not offered, and the {G} ability adds green.

